[Options]

[A.]
<h2>The Duke's Fate</h2>
<i>"The road is never straight in bridges and in life"<br>
--Will Ulkey a normal guy realizing that Nimbian bridges aren't straight.</i>  
<p>In the chaos over the control of Nimbian skies, your ally the Duke of Thunder has been seperated from you again!  This time by the clan of Elementals...it seems you may not be able to save him this time...

$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Play Mission,DoNothing,0

[Succeeded][BadTeamDead]
<h2>Success!</h2>
<p>
Amazing!!! You have kept your ally the Duke of Thunder alive and crushed the elemental clan!  Many people join you and your cause.....you will soon be the new ruler of Nimbus!!
<$Config,Done{mission.fileName}=1>
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,tnron32

[ai2TempleHalfDead]
<h2>Message from the Knight of Wind</h2>
<p>
He will pay for trying kill our friend..

[ai2PriestDead]
<h2>Message from the Knight</h2>
<p>
I wonder if life insurance for High Priests will ever happen.

[ai2PriestCaptured]
<h2>Message from the Thunder Elemental</h2>
<p>
So you ARE better than the duke...

[ai3TempleHalfDead]
<h2>Message from the Rain Elemental</h2>
<p>
Seems the Duke has some fight left in him...

[ai3TempleDead]
<h2>Message from the Rain Elemental</h2>
<p>
ARGH!!  My allies will deal with you...

[ai3PriestDead]
<h2>The Rain Elemental has died</h2>
<p>
He has died....will the others die as well?

[ai4TempleHalfDead]
<h2>Message from the Minion of Thunder</h2>
<p>
How can our plan fail?!?!?!

[ai5TempleHalfDead]
<h2>Message from the Duke of Thunder</h2>
<p>
It seems I will not survive this battle.....If I die my power will be yours....

[ai5TempleDead]
<h2>Message from the Duke of Thunder</h2>
<p>
I am doomed....Avenge me!

[ai5PriestCaptured]
<h2>Message from the Elemental Clan</h2>
<p>
He took long enough to get too....HAHAHA!!

[ai5PriestDead]
<h2>Your ally the Duke of Thunder has died!</h2>
<p>
You were unable to save your friend the Duke of Thunder......Do not let his death go unavenged!  His power will certainly help.

$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,tnron3ex

[ai6TempleDead]
<h2>Message from the Knight of Wind</h2>
<p>
We will Destroy this clan of Elementals!


[ai7TempleHalfDead]
<h2>~iMessage from Rahn</h2>
<p>
This is a branching point of my campain.  If the Duke is killed in this battle you go one way.  If he lives, then you go the other.  
<p> ~lGood Luck

$Button=Read Next,DoNothing,0

[ai7TempleDead]
<h2>~iMessage from Rahn</h2>
<p>
I'd suggest connecting to the Duke's island fast!


[ai7PriestCaptured]
<h2>Message from the Knight of Wind</h2>
<p>
Hurry, or I shall join all the enemies we have killed!!

[ai7PriestDead]
<h2>Your ally the Knight of Wind has died!</h2>
<p>
Since you were not able to save the Knight of Wind, many of your allies have run off and joined your enemies.

$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain



[Failed]
<h2>Failure!</h2>
<p>
The Elementals were too much for you and your ally the Duke of Thunder.
$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain


[END]

